      {
        "text": "Bob-E Sim uses Generative AI to create huge realistic physical outdoor and indoor environments for training a robot. The robot AI can autonomously navigate to different locations like in real life. Im developing the robot brain at the same time. THe goal is for the robot once its built to be walking anywhere autonomously, understand language and be able to follow instructions in the real world. ",
        "color": {
          "r": 0.5397010445594788,
          "g": 0.5397010445594788,
          "b": 0.5397010445594788
        },
