    "spacing": -0.78,
    "segments": [
      {
        "text": "The Drone has a wingspan of 1.40m and can carry 12kg payload. It was designed as first responder in Alpine terrain. It can launch and land vertically thanks to its tilting rotor mechanism. It is equipped with a 1080p digital camera, a thermal camera and 10x optical zoom over 30km range. The drone was tested using a 3 Billion Cell CFD Simulation on AMD MI300X GPU Servers.",
        "color": {
          "r": 0.5397010445594788,
