          "b": 0.8961463570594788
        },
        "underline": true,
        "link": null
      },
      {
        "text": " and a desktop version for Mac, Widows and Linux. With a modern design it has all the features you would expect from a capable PDF Editor, including deep text editing, watermarking, adding text, signing, protecting, censoring, translating, converting and much more. You can get it from the website or the public GitHub repo ",
