    "spacing": -0.78,
    "segments": [
      {
        "text": "This 2.5m long experimental UAV has a prototype already built and testing. It features 3 motors producing 21kg of thrust and is designed to take of and land vertically with its tilt mechanism. It already took off and landed for a short distance but the battery system is currently beeing redesigned before another flight can take place. It features a 350Wh Li-ion custom made battery pack and weighs 7.5kg in the current unfinished configuration. ",
        "color": {
          "r": 0.5397010445594788,
